        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is asynchronous code?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Code that executes while the game keeps running</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Code that executes only in a strict top-to-bottom order without waiting</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Code that executes one line at a time and can never pause</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Code that executes while the game keeps running.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What best describes the following code?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game setup&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game setup is complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Our current score is \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This log prints last&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code is synchronous</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The code is asynchronous</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There isn't enough code to reach a conclusion</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code is synchronous.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is a callback function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A function we pass into another function and call later (for example, after an enemy spawns)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A special function that can be used only once in a game</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A function that only runs by itself and can never be passed around</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A function we pass into another function and call later (for example, after an enemy spawns).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pass the callback function to the asynchronous <code>setTimeout</code> method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"setTimeout\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"callbackFunc\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawned an enemy later because we're using asynchronous code.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(callbackFunc, \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 1: game loop continues&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 2: player can still move&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>callbackFunc</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoke the callback function within <code>sayHello</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showLevelIntro = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"levelName, callback\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Entering: \" /><text value=\"${levelName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  callback();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLevel = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showLevelIntro(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", startLevel);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>callback()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the <code>setTimeout()</code> method do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It runs a callback once after a delay (like spawning a power-up after 2 seconds)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It runs its callback repeatedly at a fixed interval</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">It creates a delay timer that cancels another method automatically</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It runs a callback once after a delay (like spawning a power-up after 2 seconds).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the <code>clearInterval()</code> method do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It stops a repeating callback started by <code>setInterval()</code> (like stopping a ticking timer)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It always accepts 3 parameters</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It only works if the interval callback returns true</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It stops a repeating callback started by <code>setInterval()</code> (like stopping a ticking timer).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens in the following code?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" callback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(callback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI ticks were stopped&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The callback runs every 200 milliseconds until <code>clearInterval()</code> stops it</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The callback runs once after a 200 millisecond delay</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The callback runs every 1000 milliseconds until <code>clearInterval()</code> stops it</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The callback runs every 200 milliseconds until <code>clearInterval()</code> stops it.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoke <code>setTimeout()</code> with the callback function and a <code>1000</code> millisecond delay.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>setTimeout</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoke the <code>setInterval()</code> method with the callback function and a <code>200</code> millisecond delay. Save it to the variable <code>intervalID</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>setInterval</code>, followed by <code>ourCallback</code>, and finally <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
